  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Raising Employment Access and Development for Youth (READY)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical and vocational education and training (TVET): implementation of vocational trainings in photovoltaic electricity, pluming and agriculture related activities. The project is targeting 1300 young people from 4 regions of Burkina Faso. Acting for Life has to local partners for the implementation of the project (Assosiation Tin Tua (ATT) and Organisation Catholique pour Development et la Solidarite (OCADES) Burkina Faso</narrative>
  </description>
